{
  "label": "dojo25",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label dojo25:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Somewhere...in a far-off, distant land...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The war rages on...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Previously, on the Battle for Kumon-mi...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo1.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ayane Amamiya of the famed Amamiya dynasty made her run at a lifelong adversary in hopes of reclaiming the land that was rightfully given to her at birth.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But after a long and painstaking series of setbacks, it finally set in that this battle might not be as easy as she originally thought!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "With a fire in her heart and the determination to finish out the fight and reclaim her holy land, will she be able to summon the strength needed to defeat her arch-nemesis?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo2.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or will that nemesis simply be too powerful for her to overcome?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The leader of the Arakawa clan has no intention of giving up the land he has worked so hard to refine and reconstruct over the course of his anguish-filled life!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Can one battle truly decide the fate of everything he loves?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Can one battle turn the tide and restore the land to its original state, long before the endless wars and all of the lives lost?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo3.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Two hearts become one!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Two lost souls with nothing but regret and heavy expectations on their shoulders must set aside their love for one another to fight for the greater good!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who will win?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo4.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo5.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo6.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The following program is brought to you in part by Koi Cafe! Home of the [[copyrighted frozen beverage]!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Long day? Short night? Come to Koi Cafe and try our specialty handcrafted drinks made by adorable girls!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We will now return to our regularly scheduled programming.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Please enjoy the show!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Pluuuuus...EXTRA!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo7.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You haven’t learned a thing, have you?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’d think that after our last battle ended in a near-truce, you’d be a lot more welcoming today...father.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo8.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s right. I am your father. This was a necessary plot development.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t want you to find out like this, but I suppose it needed to happen eventually.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what do you say, Ayane?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will you join forces with me and rule this land in the name of the Arakawas?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or will you resign yourself to the cowardly Amamiyas? The same family who raised you and never told you of my existence...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo9.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They only hid you from me because they knew it would hurt!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But what hurts even more is knowing we are in love!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which I am totally okay with, by the way, but other people will probably think it’s weird!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo10.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Tap into those feelings!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Use them to become stronger, sudden-daughter of mine!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If the two of us join forces, we’ll be able to activate the hidden Arakawa-technique! The one that can only be used when father and daughter are united!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo11.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The hidden Arakawa-technique?! Do you mean the ultra-hyper-mega-drive-flame-tornado wheel-dropkick-of-unity?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heh...I guess the technique wasn’t as hidden as I thought, was it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo12.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tch!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it really okay for me to abandon the parents who raised me in order to reunite with my biological father? Especially when both of them are dying from an unidentified disease?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo13.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unidentified, you say?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well that’s just simply not true.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, I’m the one who created the disease that’s destroying their bodies as we speak.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And what’s even better-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo14.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that they only have three weeks left to live!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo15.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Only three weeks?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How could you do this, father?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s one thing to abandon me by floating my body down the river-of-lost-hope, but to create a life-threatening disease in order to kill my adoptive parents?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s simply too much!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo16.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Funny. Some say “too much” while others say “not enough.”",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Frankly, I thought about killing them much longer ago.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But six years ago, after I saw you training with a wooden sword next to your above-ground pool in the backyard, I decided I couldn’t.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was you?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo17.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And to think that all of this time I’d been hoping to meet that man...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Never did I once expect him to be the leader of the Arakawa clan who is also coincidentally my father and the man who poisoned my non-biological parents.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo18.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And that’s not all...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How much more convoluted can this get?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You see, [young]Amamiya. I am also...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo10.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You from another timeline!!!!111111111",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo19.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!!!!!!111111",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m my own dad!!!!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I killed my parents!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, almost!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo20.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This means that the only way to prevent their demise is to take back Kumon-mi by going into the past and destroying my future self before I can create me.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But how?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I haven’t learned the ability to time travel yet.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo21.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What about...him?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo22.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Him?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who are you talking about, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is a battle between father and daughter. And also father and self.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And daughter and self.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And Amamiya and Arakawa.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo23.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo23"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Until now.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo24",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo24.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo24"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean by that?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re the only two people here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": People, yes...But why not take a look behind you?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Behind me? But what-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo25.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": BACAWK! (Prepare to be eliminated!)",
      "spk": "Todd the Chicken",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-It...It can’t be!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Todd! Attack!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Todd?!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should be dead!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Todd is immortal in this timeline!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": BACAWK! (I can never die!)",
      "spk": "Todd the Chicken",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-Impossible!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo26",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo26.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Little did you know, that girl who you saw training with her sword in the backyard was also an expert chicken-tamer!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t even know that was a thing!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what’ll it be, Master Arakawa? Are you ready to concede to Todd, the only person who has ever bested you in battle?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or will you fight to the death, ultimately killing me in the process because we’re the same person?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or something.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo27",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo27.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo27"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": BACAWK! (Bow before me, mortal! It is I! Todd!)",
      "spk": "Todd the Chicken",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can he...drain my energy?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh? You’re feeling it already?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And here I was thinking you were stronger than that.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The only reason Todd is immortal is because he can consume the life essence of others by simply looking at them.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So much...power...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My legs are...getting weaker...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don’t think I can stand much longer...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo28",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo28.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo28"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t worry. You won’t have to.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Lucky for you, which basically means lucky for us, I’ve thought up a way to defeat you without killing you.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Without...killing me?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...how?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t worry about that, future-me.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just close your eyes and everything will be okay...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo29",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo29.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo29"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": AMAMIYA FAMILY HIDDEN-TECHNIQUE! THROW!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your hidden technique is “Throw?!”",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo30",
