    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And so the battle comes to a close!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ayane Amamiya of the Amamiya clan was able to defeat her arch-nemesis, the future version of herself, alongside her trusted chicken-companion, Todd!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But even though the battle has been won...things do not end here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What will happen next?! Has Ayane truly reclaimed the land of Kumon-mi?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or is there an even greater evil lurking somewhere in the shadows?...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo6.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This episode of The Battle for Kumon-mi was brought to you in part by Koi Cafe!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Long day? Short night? Come to Koi Cafe and try our specialty handcrafted drinks made by adorable girls!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Thank you for watching our regularly scheduled broadcast!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "See you next time!",
      "zh": ""
    },
