    {
      "en": "scene battletwo34",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo34.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo34"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well fought today, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I had no idea you were really me this entire time.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I guess it makes sense given how much the two of us have in common.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I figured you might like that part.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, I had no idea you owned a chicken.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? He follows me around all the time.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sometimes, I don’t even realize he’s there.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He’s a good boy, though.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why did you name him Todd? Is he American?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, he’s a chicken. Idiot.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo35",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo35.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo35"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s kind of sad that we might not be able to do stuff like this anymore soon, though...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean? The dojo isn’t closing down, is it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo36",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo36.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo36"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not sure, to be honest.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I heard the instructor talking about how someone was looking into buying it.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t have any idea what would happen to it after that.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well I can’t imagine they’d buy a dojo to just make it...not a dojo anymore.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sounds like we’ll just have new management or something.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think we’ll be impacted that much.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, couldn’t you just buy it if things really came to that? You’re rich.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo37",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo37.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo37"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": True. But just because I’m rich doesn’t mean I could buy an entire dojo without any problems.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t just put it on my credit card and my dad is the one with the actual bank-access and stuff.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m pretty sure if I asked him to buy a dojo when we already have a nicer one on the premises, he'd say no.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good point.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think we need to worry, though. I can’t imagine anything will happen to this place in the end.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo38",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo38.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo38"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hopefully you’re right. All of the times we’ve spent here have become really important memories to me.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Seeing them taken away would be kind of devastating.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Worse comes to worst, we just hang out at your house, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...Let’s hope it doesn’t come to that, though.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ayane and I remain in the dojo for another half hour or so, reminiscing about all of the times we’ve spent here over the last few months.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The reminiscing turns to something slightly more suggestive once she starts recollecting how far we've come since then.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But at least it got her mind off of the sudden potential for our normal hang-out spot to become a thing of the past.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I really hope that rumor doesn’t wind up actually being true.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m finally starting to get used to this...",
      "zh": ""
